<div class="rn">
<h2>What&#x27;s New in 4.8</h2>
<h3>Features</h3>
<ul>
<li>Show needs-input badges in the sidebar and board.</li>
<li>Expose reliable pending input state.</li>
<li>Connect the reminders destination and navigation.</li>
<li>Handle fired reminders across both owner types.</li>
<li>Compose and display grouped reminders.</li>
<li>Add editable reminder cards and precise times.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li>Preserve notarization errors before release QA.</li>
<li>Share initial status baselines before recovery.</li>
<li>Submit OpenCode question answers with Enter.</li>
<li>Use the app highlight for needs-input badges.</li>
<li>Pad and soften needs-input badges.</li>
<li>Keep needs-input badges on the title row.</li>
</ul>
<p class="more">Full release notes: <a href="https://github.com/Ajanth/hive-public/releases/tag/v4.8">https://github.com/Ajanth/hive-public/releases/tag/v4.8</a></p>
</div>
